; Logical Iota : the index-expression generator. The value at output
; coordinates (c0..ck) is the IntExpr evaluated with CoordVar(axis i)
; bound to ci — the tensor form of a single IntExpr over the shape's
; coordinate variables. Rank-1 with one CoordVar is luminal's flat
; iota; coordinates are SHAPE-OWNED (CoordVar shape axis), so the
; value expression's coordinates are expected to be owned by this
; iota's own shape (authoring convention; ownership is in the term).
(constructor LogicalIota (IntExpr Shape) LogicalTensor)
